  "description": "Enji, with a stunning face but a chubby body, is called the epitome of an unscratched lottery ticket.\"\nUsing her ability to eat more than others, she became a mukbang YouTuber.\nHowever, due to her chubby figure, she often faces ridicule.\nWith low views and stagnant subscribers, Enji is gradually losing hope.\n\nBut one day, by chance, she picks up an \"S-lottery\" ticket and decides to scratch it.\nFrom that moment on, her life begins to change overnight.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=828908), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11438865)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/drama/unscratched-lottery-ticket/list?title_no=7284)",
